    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Legend: Wukong is a Third-Person Action-Adventure game focused on exploration and combat. Take control of the legendary Wukong and explore a world full of adventures and challenges. Unlock new abilities, evolve Wukong's power, and prepare to face mysterious adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MECHANICS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Attributes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>You can level up your skills through rewards found during map exploration or through the merchant, using runes obtained from defeated enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Amulets</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>8 special amulets grant new unique abilities. Define your playstyle, equip those that best match, and unlock new secret combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Resources</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Enhance your health potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Find the special elixir and unlock elemental abilities that can be mixed with it to gain advantages against specific enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzles</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Challenges scattered across the map to balance intense combat moments with engaging exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a unique journey, utilizing Wukong's abilities and his legendary weapon, the magical staff.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Legend: Wukong is a Third-Person Action-Adventure game focused on exploration and combat. Take control of the legendary Wukong and explore a world full of adventures and challenges. Unlock new abilities, evolve Wukong's power, and prepare to face mysterious adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MECHANICS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Attributes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>You can level up your skills through rewards found during map exploration or through the merchant, using runes obtained from defeated enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Amulets</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>8 special amulets grant new unique abilities. Define your playstyle, equip those that best match, and unlock new secret combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Resources</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Enhance your health potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Find the special elixir and unlock elemental abilities that can be mixed with it to gain advantages against specific enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzles</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Challenges scattered across the map to balance intense combat moments with engaging exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a unique journey, utilizing Wukong's abilities and his legendary weapon, the magical staff.</p>",
